@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
hide empty description
state "待发送" as INIT
state "待发送" as S1
state "发送中" as S2
S1 --> S2 : 开始发送 [任务唯一]
state "平台已受理" as S3
S2 --> S3 : 平台已受理 [可信回执/受理]
state "发送失败/结果未知" as S4
S2 --> S4 : 发送失败 [平台返回失败]
S2 --> S4 : 结果未知 [超时/无回执]
S4 --> S1 : 授权重试 [订单/交付仍有效]
@enduml